The derivation covers the scanline-buffer rendering architecture, the
command-processor concept, the instruction-set opcode numbering and field
meanings, and the affine coordinate-system definitions, all taken from the
RISCBoy documentation. The RTL, golden model, framebuffer/simpledrm engine,
programmable CRTC and the GF180-specific implementation in this directory
were written for this project; differences from RISCBoy are documented in
README.md ("Attribution and derivation").

